:: ===== GRUPO 1: Musicas =====
:: Where do you want to put the backup files?
SET BACKUP_HOME_1=E:\BackUp\Musicas\backup Ableton

:: Define path and label (no spaces) for each directory you want to backup.
SET DIR1=C:\Users\andre\Music\Projetos Ableton
SET LBL1=Projetos_Ableton
SET DIR2=C:\Users\andre\Music\samples
SET LBL2=Samples
SET DIR3=C:\Users\andre\Music\My songs
SET LBL3=My_Songs

:: How many dir/lbl combinations did you define for Group 1?
SET MAX_1=3


:: ===== GRUPO 2: Outro conjunto =====
:: Where do you want to put the backup files?
SET BACKUP_HOME_2=E:\BackUp\Games\Retrobat

:: Define path and label (no spaces) for each directory you want to backup.
SET DIR_B1=D:\RetroBat\saves
SET LBL_B1=saves
SET DIR_B2=D:\RetroBat\roms
SET LBL_B2=roms

:: How many dir/lbl combinations did you define for Group 2?
SET MAX_2=2


:: ===== AGENDAMENTO (compartilhado) =====
:: How often (in days) do you want to run this script?
SET DAYS=7

:: What name to give the scheduled task.
SET SCHED_TASK_LABEL=Backup my PC every week
